  "title": "Equality in a matroidal circumference bound",
  "statement": {
    "representation": "markdown-latex",
    "text": "Question Is the binary affine cube $AG(3,2)$ the only 3-connected matroid for which equality holds in the bound $$E(M) \\leq c(M) c(M^*) / 2$$where$c(M)$is the circumference (i.e. largest circuit size) of$M$?",
